## SQ-FF-03 | cheesy dishes take cheese, not milk; the milk broccoli pot recipes are gone
@group A
@commands `cdevtest recipes` for the milk ids; `cdevtest rdetail` for each changed pot recipe
@pass no `veggiesdelight:cooking/broccoli_soup` or `veggiesdelight:cooking/pasta_with_broccoli`; nachos, truffle pasta, both creamy pastas (and the Veggies compat copies), fiery fondue pot, lasagna pan and FD stuffed potato list a cheese, no milk; the grid routes for broccoli soup, pasta with broccoli, truffle pasta and the creamy pastas take a cheese
@fails `creativedelight/cheese_for_milk.js` (replaceInput of `#forge:milk`); the grid lines in `veggiesdelight/cooking.js`, `fungidelight/cooking.js`, `moredelight/recipes.js`
> cdevtest recipes veggiesdelight:cooking/broccoli_soup
> cdevtest recipes veggiesdelight:cooking/pasta_with_broccoli
> cdevtest rdetail corn_delight:cooking/nachos_block
> cdevtest rdetail fungidelight:cooking/truffle_pasta
> cdevtest rdetail moredelight:cooking/creamy_pasta
> cdevtest rdetail veggiesdelight:compat/moredelight/cooking/creamy_pasta
> cdevtest rdetail brewinandchewin:cooking/fiery_fondue_pot
> cdevtest rdetail veggiesdelight:cooking/lasagna_pan
> cdevtest rdetail farmersdelight:stuffed_potato
> cdevtest rdetail _cooked_manual_only
waitlog verb=rdetail text=_cooked_manual_only n= 30
reject verb=recipes text=veggiesdelight:cooking/(broccoli_soup|pasta_with_broccoli) n=[1-9]
reject verb=rdetail id=(corn_delight:cooking/nachos_block|fungidelight:cooking/truffle_pasta|\S*creamy_pasta\S*|brewinandchewin:cooking/fiery_fondue_pot|veggiesdelight:cooking/lasagna_pan|farmersdelight:stuffed_potato) .*ingredients=\S*milk
reject verb=rdetail id=creativedelight:shapeless/(broccoli_soup|pasta_with_broccoli|truffle_pasta|creamy_pasta_with_chicken_cuts|creamy_pasta_with_ham)_cooked_manual_only .*ingredients=\S*milk
look each changed recipe lists a cheese (flaxen cheese wedge or cheese slice) where the milk was
reject verb=\S+ .*done=0

## SQ-FF-04 | cheesy dishes' food values went up
@group A
@commands `cdevtest food` for each dish
@pass broccoli soup 13 / 0.7, pasta with broccoli 15 / 0.8, stuffed potato 13 / 0.7, truffle pasta 15 / 0.8, both creamy pastas 15 / 0.8, nachos 13 / 1.0, lasagna slice 15 / 0.75, fiery fondue 15 / 0.75
@fails CD startup `creativedelight/cheese_values.js` (CD jar not rebuilt, or the row loaded after `food_value_copies.js` read the list); `[food values]` warnings in latest.log
@reviewed 2026-11-21
# r1121b fix (2026-11-21, judge-2): cdevtest prints modifier=1 for 1.0; nachos regex takes both
> cdevtest food veggiesdelight:broccoli_soup
> cdevtest food veggiesdelight:pasta_with_broccoli
> cdevtest food farmersdelight:stuffed_potato
> cdevtest food fungidelight:truffle_pasta
> cdevtest food moredelight:creamy_pasta_with_chicken_cuts
> cdevtest food moredelight:creamy_pasta_with_ham
> cdevtest food corn_delight:nachos_bowl
> cdevtest food veggiesdelight:lasagna_slice
> cdevtest food brewinandchewin:fiery_fondue
waitlog verb=food item=brewinandchewin:fiery_fondue\S* 30
expect verb=food item=veggiesdelight:broccoli_soup\S* food=true nutrition=13 modifier=0\.7
expect verb=food item=veggiesdelight:pasta_with_broccoli\S* food=true nutrition=15 modifier=0\.8
expect verb=food item=farmersdelight:stuffed_potato\S* food=true nutrition=13 modifier=0\.7
expect verb=food item=fungidelight:truffle_pasta\S* food=true nutrition=15 modifier=0\.8
expect verb=food item=moredelight:creamy_pasta_with_chicken_cuts\S* food=true nutrition=15 modifier=0\.8
expect verb=food item=moredelight:creamy_pasta_with_ham\S* food=true nutrition=15 modifier=0\.8
expect verb=food item=corn_delight:nachos_bowl\S* food=true nutrition=13 modifier=1(\.0)? saturation=
expect verb=food item=veggiesdelight:lasagna_slice\S* food=true nutrition=15 modifier=0\.75
expect verb=food item=brewinandchewin:fiery_fondue\S* food=true nutrition=15 modifier=0\.75
reject verb=\S+ .*done=0

## SQ-FF-05 | one stuffed pumpkin pot recipe
@group A
@commands `cdevtest makes farmersdelight:stuffed_pumpkin_block`; rdetail of the new recipe
@pass exactly one Cooking Pot maker, `creativedelight:farmersdelightcooking/stuffed_pumpkin_block`: tomato sauce, potato or sweet potato, any bread, berries, mushrooms, vegetables, pumpkin container; FD's and Corn Delight's ids gone
@fails `farmersdelight/recipes.js` "Stuffed pumpkin"
> cdevtest makes farmersdelight:stuffed_pumpkin_block
> cdevtest rdetail farmersdelightcooking/stuffed_pumpkin_block
waitlog verb=rdetail text=farmersdelightcooking/stuffed_pumpkin_block n= 30
expect verb=makes id=creativedelight:farmersdelightcooking/stuffed_pumpkin_block result=farmersdelight:stuffed_pumpkin_block\*
reject verb=makes id=(farmersdelight:cooking/stuffed_pumpkin_block|corn_delight:cooking/stuffed_pumpkin_from_cornbread)\b
look the rdetail ingredients: tomato sauce, potato/sweet potato, bread, berries, mushrooms, vegetables; container minecraft:pumpkin
reject verb=\S+ .*done=0

## SQ-FF-06 | cucumber salad pickles, veggie noodle pepper, any egg in echo cake base and cake paste
@group A
@commands rdetail of the cucumber salad, echo cake base and cake paste; tag probe of `creativedelight:veggie_noodle_veg`
@pass the cucumber salad's pickled beetroot and pickled onion slots also take `vintagedelight:pickle`; the tag holds `rusticdelight:bell_pepper_slice_green`; echo cake base and cake paste take any `#forge:eggs` (turtle egg matches)
@fails `vintagedelight/cooking.js` cucumber salad line; `vintagedelight/tags.js`; `create/recipes.js` "Any egg"
@absent create_deep_dark:compacting_echo_cake_base create_factory:cake_paste (recipe ids, not items)
> cdevtest rdetail cucumber_salad_manual_only
> cdevtest rdetail create_deep_dark:compacting_echo_cake_base
> cdevtest rdetail create_factory:cake_paste
> cdevtest tag item creativedelight:veggie_noodle_veg
waitlog verb=tag kind=item tag=creativedelight:veggie_noodle_veg n= 30
expect verb=tag kind=item tag=creativedelight:veggie_noodle_veg n=\d+ ids=.*rusticdelight:bell_pepper_slice_green
look the cucumber salad's two pickled slots list vintagedelight:pickle as an option; the egg slots of echo cake base and cake paste are a tag (or list turtle_egg)
reject verb=\S+ .*done=0

## SQ-FF-07 | fruit cuts and whole-from-slices
@group A
@commands `cdevtest makes` for each slice and whole; `cdevtest food`-free; rdetail of each `_from_whole` and `_from_slices`
@pass knife: melon 8, pumpkin 8, hamimelon 8, lemon 5 + seeds, orange 5, pineapple 6 + sapling + 50% sapling, mini cantaloupe 4; Create saw the same for hamimelon, lemon, orange, pineapple (no 8-slice pineapple saw); whole from slices, shapeless only: melon 9, pumpkin 9, hamimelon 9, lemon 6, orange 6, pineapple 9, cantaloupe 4; no `minecraft:melon` 3x3, `farmersdelight:pumpkin_from_slices` or 2x2 cantaloupe; a pumpkin broken with a knife drops 8 slices
@fails `creativedelight/fruit_cuts.js`; `farmersdelight/loot.js` (pumpkin knife break)
@absent farmersdelight:pumpkin_from_slices fruitsdelight:cutting/pineapple_slice (removed recipe ids: negative test)
> cdevtest rdetail _from_whole
> cdevtest rdetail _from_slices
# rdetail _from_slices stops at 40 of 46 matches (r1120nv): pineapple asked by id
> cdevtest rdetail creativedelight:shapeless/pineapple_from_slices
> cdevtest recipes minecraft:melon
> cdevtest recipes farmersdelight:pumpkin_from_slices
> cdevtest recipes fruitsdelight:cutting/pineapple_slice
waitlog verb=recipes text=fruitsdelight:cutting/pineapple_slice n= 30
expect verb=rdetail id=creativedelight:farmersdelightcutting/melon_slice_from_whole .*result=minecraft:melon_slice\*8
expect verb=rdetail id=creativedelight:farmersdelightcutting/pumpkin_slice_from_whole .*result=farmersdelight:pumpkin_slice\*8
expect verb=rdetail id=creativedelight:shapeless/melon_from_slices .*result=minecraft:melon\*1
# recipes is a substring search (minecraft:melon also hits melon_seeds): reject the exact id line, not the count
reject verb=recipes id=minecraft:melon result=
reject verb=recipes text=(farmersdelight:pumpkin_from_slices|fruitsdelight:cutting/pineapple_slice) n=[1-9]
expect verb=rdetail id=creativedelight:shapeless/pineapple_from_slices .*result=fruitsdelight:pineapple\*1
look each _from_whole and _from_slices line against the pass column counts
reject verb=\S+ .*done=0

