## SQ-FF-09 | edible seeds: values, tag, trail mix and stuffed cantaloupe
@group A
@commands `cdevtest food` for the five seeds; tag probe; rdetail of trail mix and stuffed cantaloupe
@pass sunflower seeds and corn kernels nutrition 1 modifier 0.25; pumpkin, oat and mixed seeds nutrition 1 modifier 0; `creativedelight:edible_seeds` holds the five; trail mix and stuffed cantaloupe take the tag, not `#forge:seeds`
@fails CD startup `creativedelight/edible_seeds.js`; `creativedelight/tags.js`; Common item_dict `t_edible_seeds` (Common jar not installed: the recipes warn an undefined ingredient)
@absent creativedelight:edible_seeds (a new tag, not in the dumps yet)
> cdevtest food hearthandharvest:sunflower_seeds
> cdevtest food corn_delight:corn_seeds
> cdevtest food minecraft:pumpkin_seeds
> cdevtest food vintagedelight:oat_seeds
> cdevtest food vintagedelight:mixed_seeds
> cdevtest tag item creativedelight:edible_seeds
> cdevtest rdetail trail_mix
> cdevtest rdetail stuffed_cantaloupe
