## SQ-FF-26 | New baked goods and kitchen items registered with their recipes
@group A
@commands reg probes for the 17 new items and the block; rdetail `plain_donut`, `blueberry_scone`, `orange_cranberry_muffin`, `carrot_muffin`, `oatmeal_raisin_cookie`, `baking_dish`, `pickled_garlic`, `boxed_raw_pasta`; tag `creativedelight:bakeware`
@pass items exist; oven `creativedelight:baking/plain_donut` -> 2 (batter, cooking oil, salt, sugar, baking sheet); `baking/blueberry_scone` -> 1 (butter, 2 blueberries, sugar, batter); `baking/orange_cranberry_muffin` -> 4 and its paper assembly -> 6; `baking/carrot_muffin` -> 4; `baking/oatmeal_raisin_cookie` -> 12 (oat dough, 2 sweeteners, raw oats, a grape); shaped `baking_dish` from 5 glass; pickling `pickled_garlic` (5 garlic, salt); `boxed_raw_pasta` 9 <-> 1; `#creativedelight:bakeware` holds `#creativedelight:bakeware/baking_dish`
@fails CD startup `creativedelight/new_foods.js` (items, block), data `creativedelight/new_foods.js` (recipes), `cd_food.js` muffinBake, `cd_transition_items.js` muffin rows, `creativedelight/tags.js` bakeware, Common item_dict keys
> cdevtest reg item creativedelight:plain_donut
> cdevtest reg item creativedelight:peach_scone
> cdevtest reg item creativedelight:pumpkin_muffin
> cdevtest reg item creativedelight:baking_dish
> cdevtest reg block creativedelight:boxed_raw_pasta
> cdevtest reg item kubejs:incomplete_orange_cranberry_muffin
> cdevtest rdetail plain_donut
> cdevtest rdetail blueberry_scone
> cdevtest rdetail orange_cranberry_muffin
> cdevtest rdetail carrot_muffin
> cdevtest rdetail oatmeal_raisin_cookie
> cdevtest rdetail baking_dish
> cdevtest rdetail pickled_garlic
> cdevtest rdetail boxed_raw_pasta
> cdevtest tag item creativedelight:bakeware
waitlog verb=tag kind=item tag=creativedelight:bakeware n= 30
expect verb=reg kind=item regex=creativedelight:plain_donut n=1\b
expect verb=reg kind=item regex=creativedelight:peach_scone n=1\b
expect verb=reg kind=item regex=creativedelight:pumpkin_muffin n=1\b
expect verb=reg kind=item regex=creativedelight:baking_dish n=1\b
expect verb=reg kind=block regex=creativedelight:boxed_raw_pasta n=1\b
expect verb=reg kind=item regex=kubejs:incomplete_orange_cranberry_muffin n=1\b
expect verb=rdetail id=creativedelight:baking/plain_donut serializer=\S+ result=creativedelight:plain_donut\*2 ingredients=.*rusticdelight:batter
expect verb=rdetail id=creativedelight:baking/blueberry_scone serializer=\S+ result=creativedelight:blueberry_scone\*1 ingredients=.*hearthandharvest:butter
expect verb=rdetail id=creativedelight:baking/orange_cranberry_muffin serializer=\S+ result=creativedelight:orange_cranberry_muffin\*4
expect verb=rdetail id=\S+orange_cranberry_muffin_sequenced_assembly serializer=\S+ result=creativedelight:orange_cranberry_muffin\*6
expect verb=rdetail id=creativedelight:baking/carrot_muffin serializer=\S+ result=creativedelight:carrot_muffin\*4
expect verb=rdetail id=creativedelight:baking/oatmeal_raisin_cookie serializer=\S+ result=creativedelight:oatmeal_raisin_cookie\*12 ingredients=.*vintagedelight:oat_dough
expect verb=rdetail id=\S+baking_dish serializer=\S+ result=creativedelight:baking_dish\*1 ingredients=.*minecraft:glass
expect verb=rdetail id=\S+pickled_garlic serializer=\S+ result=creativedelight:pickled_garlic
expect verb=rdetail id=\S+boxed_raw_pasta serializer=\S+ result=creativedelight:boxed_raw_pasta\*1
expect verb=rdetail id=\S+raw_pasta_from_boxed_raw_pasta serializer=\S+ result=farmersdelight:raw_pasta\*9
expect verb=tag kind=item tag=creativedelight:bakeware n=\d+ ids=.*creativedelight:baking_dish
reject verb=\S+ .*done=0

## SQ-FF-27 | New foods' values; pizza slices at 0.75x; Golden Roll always edible
@group A
@commands food probes on the new foods, the five pizza slices and the Golden Roll and its slice
@pass Plain Donut 4 / 0.5; scones 6 / 0.3; Orange Cranberry Muffin 5 / 0.4 with Regeneration 200 t and Shrinking 800 t; Lemon Poppy Muffin with Haste and Refreshing 200 t; veggie muffins 6 / 0.5; Oatmeal Raisin Cookie 3 / 0.2 fast; Pickled Garlic 4 / 0.5; cheese pizza slice 3 / 0.75, meat and tropical 4 / 0.7, vegan 4 / 0.47, Supreme 4 / 0.94; Golden Roll and slice always=true
@fails CD startup `new_foods.js`, `pizza_values.js` (applied by `food_value_copies.js`), roll member `RollItems` foodAlways
> cdevtest food creativedelight:plain_donut
> cdevtest food creativedelight:orange_cranberry_muffin
> cdevtest food creativedelight:lemon_poppy_muffin
> cdevtest food creativedelight:oatmeal_raisin_cookie
> cdevtest food vintagedelight:cheese_pizza_slice
> cdevtest food vintagedelight:meat_pizza_slice
> cdevtest food veggiesdelight:vegan_pizza_slice
> cdevtest food brewinandchewin:pizza_slice
> cdevtest food roll_delight:golden_roll_slice
waitlog verb=food item=roll_delight:golden_roll_slice\S* 30
expect verb=food item=creativedelight:plain_donut\S* food=true nutrition=4 modifier=0\.5
expect verb=food item=creativedelight:orange_cranberry_muffin\S* food=true nutrition=5 modifier=0\.4.*effects=.*minecraft:regeneration.*fruitsdelight:shrinking
expect verb=food item=creativedelight:lemon_poppy_muffin\S* food=true .*effects=.*minecraft:haste.*fruitsdelight:refreshing
expect verb=food item=creativedelight:oatmeal_raisin_cookie\S* food=true nutrition=3
expect verb=food item=vintagedelight:cheese_pizza_slice\S* food=true nutrition=3 modifier=0\.75
expect verb=food item=vintagedelight:meat_pizza_slice\S* food=true nutrition=4 modifier=0\.7
expect verb=food item=veggiesdelight:vegan_pizza_slice\S* food=true nutrition=4 modifier=0\.47
expect verb=food item=brewinandchewin:pizza_slice\S* food=true nutrition=4 modifier=0\.94
expect verb=food item=roll_delight:golden_roll_slice\S* food=true nutrition=10 modifier=0\.5 .*always=true
reject verb=\S+ .*done=0

## SQ-FF-28 | Cheesecakes take cheese or milk; gingerbread block; vinegar from apple jelly
@group A
@commands rdetail `syrup_cheesecake`, `gingerbread_block`, `vinegar_jar`
@pass oven `creativedelight:baking/syrup_cheesecake` (pie crust, 3 syrup, a sweetener, a slot of cheese / cheese wedge / milk bottle / milk bucket); `gingerbread_block_from_gingerbread` (9 -> 1), `gingerbread_from_gingerbread_block` (1 -> 9), smoking `gingerbread_block_from_gingerdough_block`, oven `baking/gingerbread_block`; no `create_confectionery:gingerbread_block_recipe`; pickling `vinegar_from_apple_jam` (Apple Jelly + mushroom) beside `vinegar_from_apple_mash`
