## CQ-FF-06 | Popcorn boxes place and serve flavored popcorn
@group client
@commands craft a Cheese Popcorn Box from 4 cheese popcorn and a paper; place it, take all four servings by hand, then use the empty box
@pass the box looks like Corn Delight's popcorn box and shrinks per serving; each serving is popcorn with the Cheese flavor; the empty box gives a paper and is removed
