## SQ-FF-32 | Sugar, not ghost pepper, on cookies, scones and misc baked goods
@group A
@commands tag `creativedelight:flavorable/sugar` and `creativedelight:flavorable/ghost_pepper`
@pass sugar holds `minecraft:cookie`, `hearthandharvest:raspberry_scone`, `hearthandharvest:croissant`, `creativedelight:plain_donut`, `creativedelight:peach_scone`, `creativedelight:oatmeal_raisin_cookie`, and no `canned_*cookie`; ghost pepper holds none of them (it keeps popcorn, waffles, pancakes, sweet rolls, the brownie and skewers)
@fails CD startup `flavors.js` sugarOnlyFamilies / sugarOnlyAdd / sugarOnlyRemove, data `creativedelight/flavor_tags.js`, the `cookie` and `baked/misc` family tags
> cdevtest tag item creativedelight:flavorable/sugar
> cdevtest tag item creativedelight:flavorable/ghost_pepper
waitlog verb=tag kind=item tag=creativedelight:flavorable/ghost_pepper 30
expect verb=tag kind=item tag=creativedelight:flavorable/sugar n=\d+ ids=.*minecraft:cookie\b
expect verb=tag kind=item tag=creativedelight:flavorable/sugar n=\d+ ids=.*hearthandharvest:raspberry_scone
expect verb=tag kind=item tag=creativedelight:flavorable/sugar n=\d+ ids=.*hearthandharvest:croissant
expect verb=tag kind=item tag=creativedelight:flavorable/sugar n=\d+ ids=.*creativedelight:plain_donut
expect verb=tag kind=item tag=creativedelight:flavorable/sugar n=\d+ ids=.*creativedelight:oatmeal_raisin_cookie
reject verb=tag kind=item tag=creativedelight:flavorable/sugar n=\d+ ids=.*canned_\w*cookie
reject verb=tag kind=item tag=creativedelight:flavorable/ghost_pepper n=\d+ ids=.*(minecraft:cookie\b|raspberry_scone|croissant|plain_donut)
