@group client
@commands creative inventory search for the new items; hover a golden apple, a Golden Roll slice and bread
@pass each new item shows its copied placeholder sprite (no purple-black missing texture); Boxed Raw Pasta places as a crate-bottom cube; "Can be eaten when full" under the name of the golden apple and the Golden Roll slice, not on bread
